@startuml
title Sequência de falha — pagamento recusado e compensação
autonumber
participant "Saga Orchestrator" as S
queue "Broker" as B
participant "Order Service" as O
participant "Inventory Service" as I
participant "Payment Service" as P
actor Cliente

S -> B : CreatePendingOrder
B -> O : CreatePendingOrder
O --> B : OrderCreated
B --> S : OrderCreated
S -> B : ReserveStock
B -> I : ReserveStock
I --> B : StockReserved
B --> S : StockReserved
S -> B : AuthorizePayment(idempotencyKey)
B -> P : AuthorizePayment
P --> B : PaymentRejected
B --> S : PaymentRejected
S -> S : Estado COMPENSATING
S -> B : ReleaseStock(reservationId)
B -> I : ReleaseStock
I -> I : Liberar reserva (idempotente)
I --> B : StockReleased
B --> S : StockReleased
S -> B : CancelOrder(orderId)
B -> O : CancelOrder
O -> O : Marcar CANCELLED
O --> B : OrderCancelled
B --> S : OrderCancelled
S -> S : Estado COMPENSATED
S --> Cliente : Compra não concluída

note over S,I
Se a compensação falhar temporariamente,
persistir a etapa, aplicar retry e não
marcar COMPENSATED antes da confirmação.
end note
@enduml
